  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nFrom https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#flow-content-3\n\n```css\n  inset-inline-start: 0; inset-inline-end: 0;\n```\n\nThis could just be `inset-inline: 0`, they are equivalent. See https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position/#inset-shorthands",
